  "question": "Which viewpoint are available within 140 kilometers on the northeast side of Americas Best Value Inn-Nashville/Downtown Hotel, Nashville, TN?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-86.777756 36.209722)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-86.777756 36.209722)',4326)::geography, 140000)\nAND tourism = 'viewpoint'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 22.5 AND 67.5;\n",
